Package: agrtools
Title: Tools for Managing Agricultural Data
Version: 0.0.0.9007
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Aldo",
             family = "Tapia",
             email = "aatapia@userena.cl",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-7041-9594")))
Description: Functions for agrometeorological data: unit conversion,
    hourly-to-daily aggregation, heating, cooling and growing degree days,
    chilling hours (Chandler, Utah and modified Utah models), extraterrestrial
    and clear sky radiation, and reference evapotranspiration (FAO-56
    Penman-Monteith, Hargreaves, Hargreaves-Samani and pan evaporation).
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/aldotapia/agrtools
BugReports: https://github.com/aldotapia/agrtools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
